# 🚩 Challenge: [Perceptron Train Classic 0]
![alt text](perceptron_train_classic_0.png)
## 📝 Challenge Description

Watch a perceptron learn in real time using the classic update rule: only misclassified points trigger updates, with no weight decay. This dataset is intentionally gentle, so many learning rates still converge quickly. Dial in a rate, trigger a run, and the interface will animate each step until every point is classified correctly. Visit the service in your browser:

http://xebec.cylabacademy.net:24838/

Instance
Expires in 2:03
Hints:
1. You get 16 updates per run, and correctly classified points do not change the model in the classic rule.

2. Overshooting is harder in this dataset because the clusters are well separated, but you can still watch the line swing too far if the rate is very high.

3. Use the slider to sweep the range and watch how the decision boundary moves between misclassification updates; there are many sweet spots that separate all points.

4. Binary search is a great strategy for finding a good learning rate. Try this problem
 to learn how to do a binary search.


